<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Shihas & Afiya | Wedding</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Great+Vibes&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
* { box-sizing:border-box; }

body {
  margin:0;
  background:#270b15;
  color:#e8d3a0;
  font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
  text-align:center;
}

.page {
  min-height:100vh;
  padding:35px 17px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at center,#5a2030,#270b15 75%);
}

.frame {
  max-width:480px;
  margin:auto;
  border:1px solid #bd9955;
  padding:12px;
}

.inner {
  border:1px solid #bd9955;
  padding:35px 16px;
}

.small {
  letter-spacing:4px;
  font-size:12px;
}

h1 {
  font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;
  font-size:55px;
  font-weight:400;
  line-height:1.3;
  color:#e8c982;
  margin:20px 0;
}

h2 {
  font-size:25px;
  font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:2px;
}

.gold { color:#e8c982; }

.line {
  width:75%;
  border-top:1px solid #bd9955;
  margin:25px auto;
}

p {
  font-size:19px;
  line-height:1.6;
}

.date {
  font-size:27px;
  letter-spacing:2px;
}

.photos {
  display:grid;
  gap:15px;
  margin:25px 0;
}

.photos img {
  width:100%;
  max-height:430px;
  object-fit:cover;
  border:2px solid #bd9955;
}

button {
  background:#c5a263;
  color:#35111c;
  border:0;
  padding:13px 25px;
  font-family:inherit;
  font-size:17px;
  cursor:pointer;
  margin:12px;
}

footer {
  margin-top:35px;
  font-family:'Great Vibes',cursive;
  font-size:30px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="page">
<div class="frame">
<div class="inner">

<div class="small">✦ WITH THE BLESSINGS OF ALLAH ✦</div>

<p class="gold">Together with their families</p>
<h2>Joyfully Invite You To Celebrate</h2>

<div class="line"></div>

<p class="small">THE WEDDING OF</p>

<h1>Shihas</h1>
<p class="gold">AND</p>
<h1>Afiya</h1>

<div class="line"></div>

<p>Two hearts, one beautiful journey.</p>

<div class="photos">
<img src="couple1.jpg" alt="Shihas and Afiya">
<img src="couple2.jpg" alt="Wedding memories">
</div>

<div class="line"></div>

<p class="small">SAVE THE DATE</p>
<h2 class="date">11 JANUARY 2027</h2>

<div class="line"></div>

<h2 class="gold">NIKKAH & WEDDING RECEPTION</h2>

<p>
KTCT Auditorium
</p>

<p>
The Nikkah ceremony and wedding celebration
will take place at the same venue.
</p>

<div class="line"></div>

<p>
Your gracious presence and blessings
will make our celebration truly special.
</p>

<footer>With Love, Shihas & Afiya</footer>

<button onclick="document.getElementById('music').play()">
♫ Play Music
</button>

<button onclick="document.getElementById('music').pause()">
Ⅱ Pause Music
</button>

<audio id="music" loop>
<source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>

</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
